+---
+id: dl-001-exclude-delivery-charges-from-vat
+type: decision-log
+title: "Exclude delivery charges from VAT"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Context
+
+The published business rules currently state that delivery charges carry standard-rate VAT. A
+customer reported VAT on a €4.90 delivery charge and requested that delivery, as a service, not
+receive VAT.
+
+## Decision
+
+Delivery charges are not subject to VAT. Receipts and order totals must exclude delivery VAT while
+continuing to calculate VAT on goods line by line.
+
+## Consequences
+
+Update the documented VAT rule, price calculation, and receipt coverage. Existing goods VAT
+calculation and the shipping price schedule remain unchanged.
